ed_at":"2026-11-02T22:43:29Z","browser_download_url":"https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/releases/download/v0.1.13/prism-inference-0.1.13-x86_64-pc-windows-msvc.zip"}],"tarball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/tarball/v0.1.13","zipball_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/zipball/v0.1.13","body":"Prism Inference 0.1.13 removes repeated projection-payload validation during graph construction and adds opt-in request timing APIs plus a separately prepared diagnostic tool. CPU quantization, reduction order, production copy-then-scale arithmetic, worker protocols and default selections are unchanged. No actual-model startup or throughput gain is claimed.\n\nThis source rollup also includes explicit projection-executor APIs and experimental Hexagon helpers. The CPU executables do not depend on or enable those helpers. PTQ1, adapters and additional row workers remain explicit selections; this release does not qualify PTQ1 as a default. Registry publication remains separate.\n\nThe attached Windows ARM64 and x64 archives and matching receipts are unchanged outputs of Foundation run 41535008224, attempt 1, at source `cae16fa6998dac58a947eba9ae4398ed6a9fb863`. Each archive contains five executables and four license/notice files. Independent file, source, receipt and PE architecture review passed before publication.\n\nVerified owning checks for the exact release source:\n\n- [Foundation](https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/actions/runs/41535008224)\n- [Runtime conformance](https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/actions/runs/41535008203)\n- [Source package, all three targets](https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/actions/runs/41535008364)\n\nSee the [release scope and qualification boundaries](https://github.com/symbiogenesis/prism-inference/blob/cae16fa6998dac58a947eba9ae4398ed6a9fb863/docs/release-0.1.13.md)."}